Changes made by this fork
-------------------------

* Added a third widget ("Full Dashboard") with the same information set at a larger type scale,
  intended to fill a home-screen page.
* Added a "Detailed Usage" widget: API-Key and time-range filtering, official cost / requests /
  tokens, and a CACHE / BILLING block.
* Added per-API-key usage aggregation (the upstream pipeline folded usage down to per-model
  totals, discarding the API-key dimension).
* Added `≈` estimated billing composition (cache-hit / cache-miss / output) and
  `≈` estimated cache savings, computed locally from DeepSeek's published price list.
* Split out the account-level lifetime cost (`TOTAL COST`), hidden by default behind an eye
  toggle.
* Removed the cost-trend chart from the widget UI and increased type sizes for readability.
* Added a JVM test suite, including a RemoteViews layout guard that validates every widget
  layout against the platform's `@RemoteView` requirement.
* Changed the distribution identity to `dev.randolf.deepseekwidget` so this fork can be
  installed alongside the original app. The Kotlin/manifest package name is unchanged.


